# TriggersWhenSpent$ on a Mode$ SpellAbilityCast trigger: Sunken Palace's
# second mana ability ({1}{U}, {T}, exile seven graveyard cards) makes {U}
# whose trigger copies the spell or ability it pays for
# (AbilityManaPart.java:333-339, MagicStack.java:385). Spent on Ancestral
# Recall, the copy keeps its target (confirmeffect false): human draws six.
startturn human
advance 3
queue paygeneric U
queue cardchoice 10,11,12,13,14,15,16
queue targets human
queue confirmeffect false
queue action human tapformana 2 U
queue action human tapformana 3 U
queue action human manaability 1 1
queue action human cast 4
passpriority
